WEBVTT

00:02:27.476 --> 00:02:30.271
Aha! Your missing person’s case.

00:02:30.688 --> 00:02:34.275
Someone is kidnapping the numbers
that can’t be drained:

00:02:34.275 --> 00:02:36.319
we’ll call them the immune.

00:02:36.611 --> 00:02:39.864
If you can identify the four immune 
who remain,

00:02:39.864 --> 00:02:44.243
perhaps you can get to them first
and figure out what’s going on.

00:02:44.577 --> 00:02:47.997
Who are the immune?
Pause here to figure it out yourself.

00:02:47.997 --> 00:02:50.625
Answer in 2

00:02:50.625 --> 00:02:53.127
Answer in 1

00:02:54.212 --> 00:02:59.175
There are 4 one-digit immune:
2, 3, 5, and 7.

00:02:59.383 --> 00:03:01.510
All have already been kidnapped.